{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118356","id":3510432234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RPPHq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118356","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118356.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118356.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118356","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118356/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118356/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118356/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/01e921be2879b94230f289996b90a20f73562ccb","number":118356,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix null material RID crash in ShaderMaterial property list","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118344.\r\n\r\nThe `material_set_param` call added in #110287 in `ShaderMaterial::_get_property_list()` does not check if the material RID is valid before use. When `local_to_scene` is enabled, the material RID is not yet initialized during property list generation, causing a null material error.\r\n\r\nThis adds a validity check matching the pattern used by every other `material_set_param` call site in the same file. The default value is still cached in `param_cache`, so it gets applied when `_check_material_rid()` lazily creates the material.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-09T19:40:24Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T10:10:08Z","closed_at":"2026-04-10T10:10:03Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Infiland:issue-118344","ref":"issue-118344","repo":{"id":1197797829,"node_id":"R_kgDOR2TxxQ","name":"godot","full_name":"Infiland/godot","owner":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","grav